とうれしいです。\n\n画面との自然な互动や、キャラクターらしい仕草が見られるとうれしいです。\n\nその他の部分については、キャラクターの雰囲気を大切にしながら、ご自由に解釈・アレンジしていただけるとうれしいです。\nよろしくお願いいたします。", "nc": 128, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "image", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": true}], "sent_works": [], "similar_creators": [{"id": 277, "creator": true, "nsfw_acceptable": true, "acceptable": true, "name": "萩野小唄（はぎの こうた）", "screen_name": "HaginoKouta", "avatar_url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/1009416890765041664/ZRwpC1w1.jpg", "header_url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_banners/905094895/1655819803/1500x500", "appeal_receivable": true, "popular_creator_rank": null, "request_master_rank": null, "first_requester_rank": null, "deleted_at": null, "tip_acceptable_by": "all", "accept_expiration_days": 3, "complete_expiration_days": 90, "skills": [{"genre": "art"}], "banned": false, "nc": 49}, {"id": 718315, "creator": true, "nsfw_acceptable": false, "acceptable": false, "name": "𝑺𝒖𝒑𝒆𝒓♡𝑫𝒓𝒚", "screen_name": "super_dry_rr", "avatar_url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/1489554188103462915/sQRJvZSF.jpg", "header_url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_banners/1218523218606051328/1627365841/1500x500", "appeal_receivable": false, "popular_creator_rank": null, "request_master_rank": null, "first_requester_rank": null, "deleted_at": null, "tip_acceptable_by": "all", "accept_expiration_days": 30, "complete_expiration_days": 50, "skills": [{"genre": "art"}], "banned": false, "nc": 33}, {"id": 1944760, "creator": true, "nsfw_acceptable": true, "acceptable": true, "name": "⭐️nuno⭐️", "screen_name": "nuno_art221", "avatar_url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/1657241734559174656/moKYA7yH.jpg", "header_url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_banners/1472463035252240386/1790388995/1500x500", "appeal_receivable": true, "popular_creator_rank": null, "request_master_rank": null, "first_requester_rank": null, "deleted_at": null, "tip_acceptable_by": "all", "accept_expiration_days": 30, "complete_expiration_days": 60, "skills": [{"genre": "art